Everything under this directory comes from Global Map Japan (地球地図日本),
made and published by the Geospatial Information Authority of Japan (GSI,
国土地理院) at https://www.gsi.go.jp/kankyochiri/gm_jpn.html. That page says
the GSI Content Terms of Use apply to the data. The terms, as amended on
20 November 2025 and read on 2026-10-03, apply PDL1.0 to GSI's content,
require the source to be credited (for example
"出典：国土地理院ウェブサイト（https://www.gsi.go.jp/kankyochiri/gm_jpn.html）"),
require edited or processed content to say so separately from the credit,
and forbid presenting edited content as if GSI had made it. GSI's Global Map
FAQ (https://www.gsi.go.jp/kankyochiri/gm_faq.html) asks for the credit
whether the use is commercial or not, and gives "Global Map Japan" and
"© Geospatial Information Authority of Japan" as its example.

